                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="#FF7139"><path d="M20.5 11H19V7c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2h-4V3.5C13 2.12 11.88 1 10.5 1S8 2.12 8 3.5V5H4c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2v3.8H3.5c1.49 0 2.7 1.21 2.7 2.7s-1.21 2.7-2.7 2.7H2V20c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h3.8v-1.5c0-1.49 1.21-2.7 2.7-2.7 1.49 0 2.7 1.21 2.7 2.7V22H17c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2v-4h1.5c1.38 0 2.5-1.12 2.5-2.5S21.88 11 20.5 11z"/></svg>
                  Firefox
